IndexTTS25Runner is a Julia port of IndexTeam/Bilibili IndexTTS-2.5.
Upstream: https://github.com/index-tts/index-tts (d9e41aa).
Base checkpoint: IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5 (c39ce5b).
Optional German checkpoint: sharrnah/index-tts-2.5-german (a5ac4e1).

The accompanying bilibili Model Use License Agreement applies to the model and
derivatives. Original copyright notices are retained in the accompanying files.

Modifications: inference graphs were exported into JuliaVision's operator format;
selected convolutions and attention computations were algebraically rewritten;
unused causal-mask buffers were removed; weights may be partitioned into shards.
The Julia implementation includes native spectral/text front ends and generation.

