Text normalization tables derive from WeTextProcessing, Copyright (c) 2022
Zhendong Peng and Copyright (c) 2024 Xingchen Song, under Apache License 2.0.
The runtime includes an independent tropical transducer interpreter using
OpenFst's documented shortest-path queue selection. Its token-field ordering
follows WeTextProcessing's TokenParser.
